  <ImageType>
    Portable Network Graphics (PNG) file
  </ImageType>
  <AltText>
    Sprite of Fluffy, a kittydog (think a combo hybrid of a cat and a dog, similar to a catdog) with white and light sky blue fur. They have white hair, as well as two cat ears that are black on the outside and red on the inside and two dog ears that are black on the outside and a gradient from purple to red on the inside. They also have neck fluff that is a gradient from red to purple, and a tail that is a gradient from red to purple. The background is a simple white background with a light purple heart.
  </AltText>
  <Description>
    A sprite of Fluffy :3
    Never before I had used the gradient tool in Krita this heavily, but I'm overall happy with it ^w^
  </Description>
